From: abdullahshoieb90-source
 <226442234+abdullahshoieb90-source@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 19:21:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(modules): port Hotbar Slot module from LeviLaunchroid

Adds the inbuilt "hotbar_slot" feature of LeviLaunchroid to V Client:
9 floating buttons (slots 1-9) over the game to select hotbar slots,
each movable by long-press drag with persisted position, per-slot
size/opacity/enabled settings and an optional item-icons mode.

Kotlin (UI/settings): modules/hotbarslot/* + impl/HotbarSlotModule.kt
C++ (in-game half): modules/impl/hotbar_slot.* with TODO notes for
slot-selection/item-presence hooks (offsets intentionally not guessed,
same convention as MinecraftLoader.cpp).

All JNI calls are guarded: the module keeps working as an overlay even
when libbedrock_client.so is not loaded.
